{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#0", "es": "{F871}{0100}Mira, llegaron novedades.{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#1", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡{F843}{0000} {F843}{0000}!{F801}¡Aprendí una habilidad nueva!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#2", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Crees que esta habilidad es genial?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#3", "es": "{F871}{0100}No puede ser... Tengo demasiadas habilidades...{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#4", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Por qué no cambias {F804}{0500}{F877}{0100}{F804}{0000} por {F804}{0500}{F877}{0200}{F804}{0000}?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
