{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#7", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Transformarme...? ¿No es demasiado pronto?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/DevilMsg/dMsg_Gal.mbm#8", "es": "{F871}{0100}No me hago responsable de lo que vaya a pasar.{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
